# `agents.catalogs`

Catalog rows for the agents list (harnesses, skills, etc.).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`AgentCatalogsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `skills` | `map` |
| `mcp` | `map` |
| `rules` | `map` |
| `presets` | `map` |
| `tool_patterns` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.catalogs --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "skills": [
    {
      "id": "run",
      "name": "Run",
      "description": "Launch and drive the app."
    },
    {
      "id": "verify",
      "name": "Verify"
    }
  ],
  "mcp": [
    {
      "id": "ship",
      "name": "Ship"
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "no-placeholders",
      "name": "no-placeholders"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "id": "ship-standard",
      "name": "ship-standard",
      "description": "Human confirms risky actions before they run."
    }
  ],
  "tool_patterns": [
    {
      "pattern": "Read",
      "label": "Read",
      "source": "harness"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "Bash(cargo *)",
      "label": "Bash cargo",
      "source": "bash"
    }
  ]
}
